#     `tool_stdout`)
#   - `arch_x86_lib_built_in`: TUs whose argvs differ only in Kbuild's per-object defines -> the
#     line's library carries them on its per-source map
#   - `arch_x86_lib_built_in`: TUs whose argvs differ only in Kbuild's per-object defines -> a
#     cc_per_source_library piece of its own; the defines ride the per-source map
